+5. CONCLUSIONS 
papers/Fault_Detection_and_Diagnosis_in_Tennessee_Eastman_Process_with_Deep_Autoencoder.md:628: trailing whitespace.
+       An important branch of deep learning neural networks 
papers/Fault_Detection_and_Diagnosis_in_Tennessee_Eastman_Process_with_Deep_Autoencoder.md:629: trailing whitespace.
+- deep autoencoder has been studied for fault detection in 
papers/Fault_Detection_and_Diagnosis_in_Tennessee_Eastman_Process_with_Deep_Autoencoder.md:630: trailing whitespace.
+Tennessee Eastman Process  benchmark. The performance 
papers/Fault_Detection_and_Diagnosis_in_Tennessee_Eastman_Process_with_Deep_Autoencoder.md:631: trailing whitespace.
+of an optimized five -layers DAE model for fault detection 
papers/Fault_Detection_and_Diagnosis_in_Tennessee_Eastman_Process_with_Deep_Autoencoder.md:632: trailing whitespace.
+of all  TEP-generated faults  is compared with an 
papers/Fault_Detection_and_Diagnosis_in_Tennessee_Eastman_Process_with_Deep_Autoencoder.md:633: trailing whitespace.
+established linear method, PCA.  A big advantage of the 
papers/Fault_Detection_and_Diagnosis_in_Tennessee_Eastman_Process_with_Deep_Autoencoder.md:634: trailing whitespace.
+proposed DAE is the automatic variable selection  it 
papers/Fault_Detection_and_Diagnosis_in_Tennessee_Eastman_Process_with_Deep_Autoencoder.md:635: trailing whitespace.
+provides, based on reconstruction errors. The method 
papers/Fault_Detection_and_Diagnosis_in_Tennessee_Eastman_Process_with_Deep_Autoencoder.md:636: trailing whitespace.
+provides superior results with automatic variable selection 
papers/Fault_Detection_and_Diagnosis_in_Tennessee_Eastman_Process_with_Deep_Autoencoder.md:637: trailing whitespace.
+and higher fault detection rate. Without tedious variable 
papers/Fault_Detection_and_Diagnosis_in_Tennessee_Eastman_Process_with_Deep_Autoencoder.md:638: trailing whitespace.
+selection before training process, DAE simplified the 
papers/Fault_Detection_and_Diagnosis_in_Tennessee_Eastman_Process_with_Deep_Autoencoder.md:639: trailing whitespace.
+modeling procedures by detecting all the variables, which 
papers/Fault_Detection_and_Diagnosis_in_Tennessee_Eastman_Process_with_Deep_Autoencoder.md:640: trailing whitespace.
+is suitable for monitoring large industrial systems. 
papers/Fault_Detection_and_Diagnosis_in_Tennessee_Eastman_Process_with_Deep_Autoencoder.md:641: trailing whitespace.
+Furthermore, important variables , selected by DAE  
papers/Fault_Detection_and_Diagnosis_in_Tennessee_Eastman_Process_with_Deep_Autoencoder.md:642: trailing whitespace.
+algorithm, is a vital information for root-cause analysis of 
papers/Fault_Detection_and_Diagnosis_in_Tennessee_Eastman_Process_with_Deep_Autoencoder.md:643: trailing whitespace.
+the faults by engineers and data analyst s.  Compared with 
papers/Fault_Detection_and_Diagnosis_in_Tennessee_Eastman_Process_with_Deep_Autoencoder.md:644: trailing whitespace.
+linear PCA method, nonlinear transformation of features 
papers/Fault_Detection_and_Diagnosis_in_Tennessee_Eastman_Process_with_Deep_Autoencoder.md:645: trailing whitespace.
+embedded in the dataset by DAE can capture more useful 
papers/Fault_Detection_and_Diagnosis_in_Tennessee_Eastman_Process_with_Deep_Autoencoder.md:646: trailing whitespace.
+information when fault occurs, resulting in a higher fault 
papers/Fault_Detection_and_Diagnosis_in_Tennessee_Eastman_Process_with_Deep_Autoencoder.md:647: trailing whitespace.
+detection rate. The higher rates have been demonstrated 
papers/Fault_Detection_and_Diagnosis_in_Tennessee_Eastman_Process_with_Deep_Autoencoder.md:648: trailing whitespace.
+for most of the explored faults. Despite the advantages of 
papers/Fault_Detection_and_Diagnosis_in_Tennessee_Eastman_Process_with_Deep_Autoencoder.md:649: trailing whitespace.
+our proposed method, DAE can only be applied to steady 
papers/Fault_Detection_and_Diagnosis_in_Tennessee_Eastman_Process_with_Deep_Autoencoder.md:650: trailing whitespace.
+processes. To adopt DAE into dynamic industrial systems 
papers/Fault_Detection_and_Diagnosis_in_Tennessee_Eastman_Process_with_Deep_Autoencoder.md:651: trailing whitespace.
+with thousands of variables is a formidable challenge. The 
papers/Fault_Detection_and_Diagnosis_in_Tennessee_Eastman_Process_with_Deep_Autoencoder.md:652: trailing whitespace.
+next step will be focusing on designing a proper DAE 
papers/Fault_Detection_and_Diagnosis_in_Tennessee_Eastman_Process_with_Deep_Autoencoder.md:653: trailing whitespace.
+architecture for a real-world application.  
