+I INTRODUCTION 
papers/Statistical_Principles_for_Clinical_Trials_ICH_E9_1998.md:132: trailing whitespace.
+1.1 Background and Purpose 
papers/Statistical_Principles_for_Clinical_Trials_ICH_E9_1998.md:133: trailing whitespace.
+The efficacy and safety of medicinal products s hould be demonstrated by clinical trials which 
papers/Statistical_Principles_for_Clinical_Trials_ICH_E9_1998.md:134: trailing whitespace.
+follow the guidance in 'Good Clinical Practice: Consolidated Guideline' (ICH E6) adopted by 
papers/Statistical_Principles_for_Clinical_Trials_ICH_E9_1998.md:135: trailing whitespace.
+the ICH, 1 May 1996. The role of statistics in clinical trial design and analysis is 
papers/Statistical_Principles_for_Clinical_Trials_ICH_E9_1998.md:136: trailing whitespace.
+acknowledged as essential in that ICH guideline. The proliferation of statistical research in the 
papers/Statistical_Principles_for_Clinical_Trials_ICH_E9_1998.md:137: trailing whitespace.
+area of clinical trials coupled with the critical  role of clinical research in the drug approval 
papers/Statistical_Principles_for_Clinical_Trials_ICH_E9_1998.md:138: trailing whitespace.
+process and health care in general necessitate a succinct document on statistical issues related 
papers/Statistical_Principles_for_Clinical_Trials_ICH_E9_1998.md:139: trailing whitespace.
+to clinical trials. This guidance is written primarily to attempt to harmonise the principles of 
papers/Statistical_Principles_for_Clinical_Trials_ICH_E9_1998.md:140: trailing whitespace.
+statistical methodology applied to clinical tr ials for marketing applications submitted in 
papers/Statistical_Principles_for_Clinical_Trials_ICH_E9_1998.md:141: trailing whitespace.
+Europe, Japan and the United States. 
papers/Statistical_Principles_for_Clinical_Trials_ICH_E9_1998.md:142: trailing whitespace.
+As a starting point, this guideline utilised the CPMP (Committee for Proprietary Medicinal 
papers/Statistical_Principles_for_Clinical_Trials_ICH_E9_1998.md:143: trailing whitespace.
+Products) Note for Guidance entitled 'Biostatistical Methodology in Clinical Trials in 
papers/Statistical_Principles_for_Clinical_Trials_ICH_E9_1998.md:144: trailing whitespace.
+Applications for Marketing Authorisations fo r Medicinal Products' (December, 1994). It was 
papers/Statistical_Principles_for_Clinical_Trials_ICH_E9_1998.md:145: trailing whitespace.
+also influenced by 'Guidelines on the Statistical Analysis of Clinical Studies' (March, 1992) 
papers/Statistical_Principles_for_Clinical_Trials_ICH_E9_1998.md:146: trailing whitespace.
+from the Japanese Ministry of Health and Welfare and the U.S. Food and Drug 
papers/Statistical_Principles_for_Clinical_Trials_ICH_E9_1998.md:147: trailing whitespace.
+Administration document entitled 'Guideline fo r the Format and Content of the Clinical and 
papers/Statistical_Principles_for_Clinical_Trials_ICH_E9_1998.md:148: trailing whitespace.
+Statistical Sections of a New Drug Application' (J uly, 1988). Some topics related to statistical 
papers/Statistical_Principles_for_Clinical_Trials_ICH_E9_1998.md:149: trailing whitespace.
+principles and methodology are also embedded within other ICH guidelines, particularly those 
papers/Statistical_Principles_for_Clinical_Trials_ICH_E9_1998.md:150: trailing whitespace.
+listed below. The specific guidance that contains related text will be identified in various 
papers/Statistical_Principles_for_Clinical_Trials_ICH_E9_1998.md:151: trailing whitespace.
+sections of this document. 
papers/Statistical_Principles_for_Clinical_Trials_ICH_E9_1998.md:152: trailing whitespace.
+E1A: The Extent of Population Exposure to Assess Clinical Safety 
papers/Statistical_Principles_for_Clinical_Trials_ICH_E9_1998.md:153: trailing whitespace.
+E2A: Clinical Safety Data Management: Definitions and Standards for Expedited 
papers/Statistical_Principles_for_Clinical_Trials_ICH_E9_1998.md:154: trailing whitespace.
+Reporting 
papers/Statistical_Principles_for_Clinical_Trials_ICH_E9_1998.md:155: trailing whitespace.
