papers/Statistical_Principles_for_Clinical_Trials_ICH_E9_1998.md:167: trailing whitespace.
+M3: Non-Clinical Safety Studies for the Conduct of Human Clinical Trials for 
papers/Statistical_Principles_for_Clinical_Trials_ICH_E9_1998.md:168: trailing whitespace.
+Pharmaceuticals. 
papers/Statistical_Principles_for_Clinical_Trials_ICH_E9_1998.md:169: trailing whitespace.
+This guidance is intended to give direction to  sponsors in the design, conduct, analysis, and 
papers/Statistical_Principles_for_Clinical_Trials_ICH_E9_1998.md:170: trailing whitespace.
+evaluation of clinical trials of an investigationa l product in the context of its overall clinical 
papers/Statistical_Principles_for_Clinical_Trials_ICH_E9_1998.md:171: trailing whitespace.
+development. The document will also assist scientific experts charged with preparing 
papers/Statistical_Principles_for_Clinical_Trials_ICH_E9_1998.md:172: trailing whitespace.
+application summaries or assessing evidence of efficacy and safety, principally from clinical 
papers/Statistical_Principles_for_Clinical_Trials_ICH_E9_1998.md:173: trailing whitespace.
+trials in later phases of development. 
